  m_text: '<size=1.5em> <b>Region 1: Squaring the Binomial</b></size>



    Oh no!
    The cannon needs a <b>Four-Pointed Star</b> to shoot the bomb. Only by following
    the <b>"Squaring the Binomial"</b> Process can we make the star. Please Help
    us Dear Savior!


